    "If it isn't being recorded now, click Recover. Nothing recorded is deleted." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Si no se está grabando ahora, hacer clic en Recuperar. No se borra nada de lo grabado."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If screen recording is already allowed in System Settings, macOS applies it after reopening the app." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Si la grabación de pantalla ya está permitida en Ajustes del Sistema, macOS la aplica al volver a abrir la app."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If you denied it, the system audio track will be silent. You can change it in System Settings → Privacy & Security → Screen & System Audio Recording." : {
      "comment" : "Under the system audio permission once it was asked for: macOS doesn't say whether it was allowed",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Si se negó, la pista de audio del sistema quedará en silencio. Se puede cambiar en Ajustes del Sistema → Privacidad y seguridad → Grabación de pantalla y audio del sistema."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In this version the camera is only a preview: this recording doesn't include it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
